**How to use**
Write todo tasks down here.
This isn't an exhaustive list
Do not delete items until you've finished the PR
Move the "todo after PR" items into the "todo before sending PR" section once you've **finished merging the PR**
Once the list is exhausted, check Future Reference.md in /docs for more things to do.
If that's exhausted as well, it's probably time to make a release.

**Todo before sending a PR**
- ~~Finish the client~~ 
    - ~~Link the communication interface with the client~~
    - ~~Handle client logic~~
        - ~~Save last ack on memory~~
        - ~~incomming death link id handling~~
        - ~~Obtaining and sending information from and to the host~~
        - ~~Handling messages sent by the user on the client~~

- ~~Modify the communication interface so it receives slotdata (slot_name, address)~~ 

